    "result_text": "The change is complete and the test suite is green.\n\nI made a single, self-contained change to `BusinessDays.java` (one file, low structural impact):\n\n- Added a private `HOLIDAYS` set with the five pinned dates.\n- Added a tiny `isBusinessDay` helper (CC 1).\n- Rewrote `toBusinessDay` as a simple loop that rolls forward off weekends **and** holidays \u2014 this also correctly handles the case where a weekend roll lands on a holiday (e.g. Sat \u2192 Mon holiday \u2192 Tue).\n\nBoth callers (`OwnerMapper.effectiveRegistrationDate` and the daily-limit/bulk-signup advices) pick up the new behavior automatically since they all route through `BusinessDays.toBusinessDay`, so no other files needed touching. `BUILD SUCCESS`, all tests pass.",
